    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the adrenaline-fueled intensity of modern drone warfare like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator</i> is a high-octane action game that puts you in direct control of cutting-edge FPV drones on deadly kamikaze missions. Navigate realistic battlefields, outmaneuver enemy defenses, and strike high-value targets with surgical precision. Whether you're an action junkie or a fan of flight simulators, this game delivers a fresh, immersive perspective on tactical combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the controls of anti-tank kamikaze drones, perform top-down grenade strikes, and fly night missions using infrared and night vision tech. Every mission challenges your reflexes, tactics, and decision-making as you engage enemy infantry, tanks, artillery, and fortified bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 5 combat maps + a dedicated training zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Anti-tank kamikaze and grenade-drop drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Night vision and infrared camera support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Day/night missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Realistic flight &amp; explosion physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Enemy tanks, IFVs, artillery, and infantry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re just getting started. Upcoming updates will bring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 New drone types with unique capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26 Dynamic weather systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Smarter enemy AI and more complex missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Building and vehicle destruction systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Community-suggested content</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built With Realism in Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a simulation grounded in real-world tech. We aim to create the most authentic FPV drone warfare experience available, and community feedback is a vital part of that journey. Expect regular updates, surveys, and open discussion with the developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! I\u2019m an indie developer from the Kyrgyz Republic. Many players ask where I\u2019m from, so here it is. This game is a <strong>neutral project</strong> \u2014 it does not support <strong>any side in current military conflicts</strong> (e.g., Russia-Ukraine, Israel-Palestine). My goal is to build a realistic simulator that explores the capabilities of modern drones without taking political stances.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the adrenaline-fueled intensity of modern drone warfare like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator</i> is a high-octane action game that puts you in direct control of cutting-edge FPV drones on deadly kamikaze missions. Navigate realistic battlefields, outmaneuver enemy defenses, and strike high-value targets with surgical precision. Whether you're an action junkie or a fan of flight simulators, this game delivers a fresh, immersive perspective on tactical combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the controls of anti-tank kamikaze drones, perform top-down grenade strikes, and fly night missions using infrared and night vision tech. Every mission challenges your reflexes, tactics, and decision-making as you engage enemy infantry, tanks, artillery, and fortified bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 5 combat maps + a dedicated training zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Anti-tank kamikaze and grenade-drop drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Night vision and infrared camera support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Day/night missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Realistic flight &amp; explosion physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Enemy tanks, IFVs, artillery, and infantry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re just getting started. Upcoming updates will bring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 New drone types with unique capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26 Dynamic weather systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Smarter enemy AI and more complex missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Building and vehicle destruction systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Community-suggested content</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built With Realism in Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a simulation grounded in real-world tech. We aim to create the most authentic FPV drone warfare experience available, and community feedback is a vital part of that journey. Expect regular updates, surveys, and open discussion with the developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! I\u2019m an indie developer from the Kyrgyz Republic. Many players ask where I\u2019m from, so here it is. This game is a <strong>neutral project</strong> \u2014 it does not support <strong>any side in current military conflicts</strong> (e.g., Russia-Ukraine, Israel-Palestine). My goal is to build a realistic simulator that explores the capabilities of modern drones without taking political stances.</p>",
    "short_description": "An intense FPV drone warfare simulator with online multiplayer and co-op modes. Take control of modern kamikaze drones in a high-adrenaline combat experience where precision, speed, and tactics decide your success. Play solo or team up with friends to destroy enemy tanks, vehicles, and bases.",
